# ---- DHS/MIS survey data: RESTRICTED ------------------------------------------
# The DHS Program does not allow redistribution of its microdata. Anyone
# re-running the analysis must register with the DHS Program, request access
# for their own project and enter their own credentials (DHS_EMAIL and
# DHS_PROJECT in the project .Renviron; see README "Data access").
# rdhs login configuration and raw-download cache
rdhs.json
**/dhs_raw_cache/
# raw DHS/MIS files, in case any are saved inside the project
*.DTA
*.dta
*.SAV
*.sav
*FL.zip
*FL.ZIP
# Every pipeline output: DHS/MIS pull and transformations (01_pull_mis_data/,
# 02_structure_mis_data/), regression fits that embed the individual-level
# data (03b_brms_int_cluster_fit/), and calibration files built from the
# survey data and site files (04_grid_simulation/ to 06_hierarchical_fitting/).
outputs/
# Knitted reports and caches (launch.R renders results_numbers.Rmd to a
# temporary folder; these patterns catch a manual knit)
*.html
src/results_numbers_cache/
src/results_numbers_files/

# Manuscript: kept outside this repository (HRP2_MANUSCRIPT_DIR, see README)
manuscript/

# ---- Site files: RESTRICTED, available on request ------------------------------
# Site files (SITE_CACHE_DIR, UGA_SNT_SITE_FILE in src/functions/paths.R) and
# anything cached from them.
data/site_files/
*_site.rds
*_site.RDS
site.RDS
**/site_cache/
**/base_pars_cache*/

# ---- Results: archived on Zenodo, not in git (README "Results and posterior
# estimates"): numbers.tex, the LOO table and results/posteriors/
results/

# ---- Tracked on purpose ---------------------------------------------------------
# src/, data/ (public inputs), figures/ (manuscript figures written by
# src/plots.R, and figures/static/ for the hand-drawn model framework).
# The local .Renviron (credentials, paths) is ignored above; .Renviron.example
# is the template.
